  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Vapaad</defName>
    <label>vapaad</label>
    <description>A squat, dark blue-grey predator from the energy-world Sarapin and its moons: a hunched tripod arch around a glowing blue orb of a body, a crown of small red eyes on top, and a fringe of whip-like tentacles, seven at the least and as many as twenty-three in the largest specimen on record. It kills by lashing its prey so fast that the tentacles are only a blur to the naked eye, and no one can say how many it carries until it is dead.</description>
